      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. For each i in nums:\n     num = nums[i]\n\n2. Calculate complement:\n     complete = target - num\n\n3. Search for complement:\n     index = indexOf(complete)\n\n4. Check conditions:\n     index != -1  (found)\n     index != i    (not self)\n\n5. If both true:\n     return [i, index]\n\n6. If loop ends:\n     return []",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top"
    },
